Source: supivpn
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Stanislav Kazachkov <enot@supivpn.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://supivpn.com
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/SupiVPN/supivpn.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/SupiVPN/supivpn

Package: supivpn-node
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, openvpn (>= 2.7.8), openvpn (<< 2.7.9~), systemd (>= 257)
Description: SupiVPN node agent and OpenVPN integration
 Authorizes OpenVPN sessions through a SupiVPN controller. Includes the
 profile/key bootstrap CLI and a dedicated pair of systemd services.
 Installation leaves services disabled. Configuration and activation
 are explicit operator actions.

Package: supivpn-controller
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser, ca-certificates, systemd (>= 257)
Description: SupiVPN authorization controller and database migration CLI
 Provides SAML login, group access policy and browser profile issuance.
 Requires a reachable PostgreSQL 18 database, supplied separately.
 Installation never starts services or runs database migrations.

Package: supivpn
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, supivpn-node (= ${binary:Version}), supivpn-controller (= ${binary:Version})
Description: combined VPN node and authorization controller
 Installs matching versions of both SupiVPN components on one host.
 Configuration, database migration and service activation remain explicit.
